@startuml diagrama-minerador

title Bloco 2 — mineração GitHub → JSON em cache

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
left to right direction

package "codigo/mineirador" as mineirador {

  class MinerConfig <<configuration>> {
    + owner : str
    + repo : str
    + tokens : list[str]
    + output_dir : Path
    + cache_dir : Path
    + per_page : int
    + max_retries : int
    + request_delay : float
    __
    / repo_full_name : str {readOnly}
    / output_file : Path {readOnly}
    / has_token : bool {readOnly}
  }

  class GitHubMinerador {
    - _config : MinerConfig
    - _cache : CacheJson
    - _client : GitHubClient
    __
    + run() : Path
  }

  class GitHubClient {
    - _config : MinerConfig
    - _cache : CacheJson
    __
    + get_all_issues() : list[dict]
    + get_all_issue_comments() : list[dict]
    + get_all_issue_events() : list[dict]
    + get_all_pulls() : list[dict]
    + get_all_pull_review_comments() : list[dict]
    + get_pull_reviews(pull_number : int) : list[dict]
  }

  class CacheJson {
    - _dir : Path
    __
    + get(key : str) : Any
    + set(key : str, data : Any) : void
    + has(key : str) : bool
    + invalidate(key : str) : void
    + clear() : void
  }

  class Interaction <<DTO>> {
    + source_user : str
    + target_user : str
    + type : str
    + weight : int
    + repo : str
    + created_at : str
    __
    + to_dict() : dict
  }

  class RateLimitError <<exception>> {
  }
}

class "urllib" as Urllib <<library>> {
}

class "Exception" as PyException <<external>> {
}

GitHubMinerador *-- MinerConfig : config
GitHubMinerador *-- CacheJson : cache
GitHubMinerador *-- GitHubClient : client
GitHubMinerador ..> Interaction : «create»

GitHubClient ..> MinerConfig : usa
GitHubClient ..> CacheJson : usa
GitHubClient ..> Urllib : HTTP
GitHubClient ..> RateLimitError : «raise»

RateLimitError --|> PyException

note bottom of GitHubClient
  Throttle, rotação de tokens e retry
  em 403/429 / erro de rede.
end note

note bottom of GitHubMinerador
  Saída: **interacoes.json** (JSON Lines).
  Não importa o pacote de grafos.
end note

note right of MinerConfig
  ``request_delay`` = 0,75 s / |tokens|.
  ``tokens``: ``GITHUB_TOKEN`` ou ``GITHUB_TOKENS``.
end note

note right of Interaction
  Implementada como ``@dataclass`` em ``miner.py``.
end note

@enduml
